MadVoro Installation Instructions
==================================

Prerequisites
-------------
- CMake >= 3.14
- C++17 compiler (g++, clang++, icpx, etc.)
- Boost >= 1.74.0

Optional:
- MPI implementation (OpenMPI, IntelMPI, MPICH)
- HDF5 >= 1.8.0 with C++ bindings
- VTK >= 9.3.0
- VCL (Vector Class Library)

Basic Build
-----------
    cmake -B build
    cmake --build build -j$(nproc)
    cmake --install build

Custom Install Location
-----------------------
    cmake -B build -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/your/install/path
    cmake --build build -j$(nproc)
    cmake --install build

With MPI Support
----------------
    cmake -B build -DMADVORO_WITH_MPI=ON
    cmake --build build -j$(nproc)

All Options
-----------
    MADVORO_WITH_MPI=ON/OFF     MPI support (default: OFF)
    MADVORO_WITH_HDF5=ON/OFF    HDF5 output support (default: OFF)
    MADVORO_WITH_VTK=ON/OFF     VTK visualization (default: OFF)
    MADVORO_WITH_VCL=ON/OFF     VCL vectorization (default: OFF)
    MADVORO_BUILD_EXAMPLES=ON/OFF  Build examples (default: OFF)
    BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON/OFF    Shared library (default: OFF, static)

See README.md for full details.
